<title>MALAYSIA: Metrojaya year net at 14.03 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Metrojaya year net at 14.03 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  14.03   vs	   9.41</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 29.8    vs	  22.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		   251.67   vs	 238.27</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    23.02   vs	  15.71</p>
<p>    Minorities	    add  0.65   vs   add   0.76</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)     15.0    vs	  15.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Metrojaya Bhd operates departmental stores and rents out properties.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
